  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If you use VRCPlayerApi.SetVoiceDistanceFar() or VRCPlayerApi.SetVoiceDistanceNear() The the value seems to get clamped to a maximum of 10000.\n\nI would like the maximum range to be as high as possible for stuff like aircraft radios.",
